:: start default
> welcome@11111111111111111111
  Welcome.
! immediate play_chime()
? enter@22222222222222222222 requires=(has_clearance())
  Enter.
  -> work
? leave@33333333333333333333
  Leave.
  -> END

:: work
! deferred mark_seen()
! blocking grant_key()
> result@44444444444444444444
  The key is yours.
-> END
